OL,3,GNEWSASummer heatwave of 1976 was 'like
OL,4,Aa war zone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople who lived through the heatwave
OL,7,Fof 1976 have said memories of the
OL,8,Fflames, intense heat and fear remain as
OL,9,Fvivid today as they were 50 years ago.
OL,11,FDorset and Hampshire residents,
OL,12,Ffirefighters and police officers
OL,13,Frecalled fast-moving blazes that
OL,14,Fthreatened a fuel depot, forced a
OL,15,Fhospital evacuation and left
OL,16,Fcommunities on edge.
OL,18,FThe 1976 heatwave saw 15 consecutive
OL,19,Fdays of temperatures exceeding 32C, and
OL,20,Fcomparisons have been made between the
OL,21,FUK's recent high temperatures and the
OL,22,Fheatwave 50 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
