OL,3,GNEWSASummer heatwave of 1976 was 'like
OL,4,Aa war zone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany said they could still remember
OL,7,Fsleepless nights, the smell of smoke
OL,8,Fand uncertainty over what might happen
OL,9,Fnext.
